    <briefdescription>
<para>Fixture for document-store benchmarks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1bench_1_1document_1_1_document_store_fixture_1a356d9b73ef22e7566ed5359bc7fa6f21" kindref="member">SetUp()</ref> pre-populates <computeroutput>kPreloadCount</computeroutput> documents in kReadCollection to provide stable targets for GetLatency, ListThroughput, CountLatency, and UpdateThroughput. PutThroughput and RemoveThroughput manage their own data in kWriteCollection using per-iteration unique IDs.</para>
<para>A separate InMemoryDocumentSchemaEvolution is initialised with a 10-field schema for DST-BM-08. Pre-built document bodies avoid JSON construction overhead inside the schema-validation measurement loop.</para>
<para>Seed: kDocCanonicalSeed = 42 drives the std::mt19937 used for random document access in GetLatency. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
